{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.poster.avif?t=1773942730\" width=840 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.webm?t=1773942730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.mp4?t=1773942730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90Manipulate puzzles and uncover hidden hearts!\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interactive picture book style puzzles and mechanisms while hunting for hidden hearts across a ballpoint pen illustrated universe, in this sandbox object hunting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn handles to rotate stars, conquer the mini-game, and discover hidden hearts, on a slow voyage across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts are cleverly tucked away among the background art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1773942730\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1773942730 width=1560 height=1184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90Hop between planets at your own pace, and in your way!\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is full of clever gimmicks, including a slot machine, musical instruments, a mini-game, and even levers that can rotate entire planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the right puzzles to board rockets and travel to the next planet. \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the vast universe will expand in open-world fashion. There are no time limits, leaving you free to explore new worlds and hunt for hearts at your own laidback pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop back and forth between adorable, off-kilter planets as you solve the riddles of the stars, uncovering all there is to be found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/bbe8b5c8ce89f074a09c3ce5802bdd74.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8Hand-drawn art\ud83d\udd8a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intricate universe of Heartreasure was lovingly illustrated using ballpoint pen. Find hidden hearts to trigger adorable animations and reveal cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6A heartwarming soundtrack\ud83c\udfb9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1773942730\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1773942730\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/5deeac7e19c0bfcded7ba617a899c6ff561c769f.jpg"},{"name":"Meteorite completed.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/f3e090d4b7148854d2062d7321403282a3efd82d.jpg"},{"name":"First hearts given!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/d3cbc083cf0348742bd63e6e78aabc23d9f91b09.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv2.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/10a8bfaccb02c2184745820bfd15547d4bf6fb17.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/dfe58e430bf6c10ed434c3b5d88304c4de0f077b.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/a79ed86aa37cb5ccc5039f8be66bd8507cd53aab.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/d4c1880163cd2f186c9b49a8aa4311c76f9ee087.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/debc646338f10d15b39623c1a330c4c3c4863c54.jpg"},{"name":"More hearts given! Lv7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/f5c60c74b88581abcd86658aeea30b8e1cdaff70.jpg"},{"name":"\u201cBitpolis\u201d discovered.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3530160/8750861ec076b528a23961ab31f8283e0f4ff539.jpg"}],"total":56},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530160?t=1773942730","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/58d4d9cef8f274a740c810d6ab0c71f6a9acaa40/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773942730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/d132713bf3d481e4654f176a5bb83064a44dbd2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773942730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/d132713bf3d481e4654f176a5bb83064a44dbd2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773942730","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.poster.avif?t=1773942730\" width=840 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.webm?t=1773942730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/6a3c9dee40fb7de16abae9a332e6f68c.mp4?t=1773942730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90Manipulate puzzles and uncover hidden hearts!\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interactive picture book style puzzles and mechanisms while hunting for hidden hearts across a ballpoint pen illustrated universe, in this sandbox object hunting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn handles to rotate stars, conquer the mini-game, and discover hidden hearts, on a slow voyage across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts are cleverly tucked away among the background art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1773942730\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras_big/ad32c3d6000280559d0b8f1d0a9f94fa.avif?t=1773942730 width=1560 height=1184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90Hop between planets at your own pace, and in your way!\u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet is full of clever gimmicks, including a slot machine, musical instruments, a mini-game, and even levers that can rotate entire planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the right puzzles to board rockets and travel to the next planet. \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the vast universe will expand in open-world fashion. There are no time limits, leaving you free to explore new worlds and hunt for hearts at your own laidback pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop back and forth between adorable, off-kilter planets as you solve the riddles of the stars, uncovering all there is to be found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/bbe8b5c8ce89f074a09c3ce5802bdd74.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8Hand-drawn art\ud83d\udd8a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intricate universe of Heartreasure was lovingly illustrated using ballpoint pen. Find hidden hearts to trigger adorable animations and reveal cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/f32b0aac8c132f3ede3b1effebe9b05e.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=996 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6A heartwarming soundtrack\ud83c\udfb9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original piano music composed by renowned former Nintendo composer Daisuke Shiiba. Music was recorded live, using reel-to-reel tape, for a rich, calm, analog sound that breathes warm life into this curious galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/c88d73565be5741907851e4995de40aa.avif?t=1773942730\" width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: click, drag, and mousewheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit. For a hidden object game that feels like turning the pages of a storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages young to old. And for gamers and non-gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal your heart, with this relaxing voyage of galactic discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.gif?t=1773942730\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/extras/9b6afb9f66f4fccefa623e5de7191d99.poster.avif?t=1773942730\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","developers":["asaha"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530160/273bd3585be936816134ab8003840a46588b7e25/header.jpg?t=1773942730","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2015 model or newer recommended) or Apple Silicon (M1 chip or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 7850 (2 GB VRAM) equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3530160/295921376/04a9056c43dd09fd5dce222be1893074acb42248/1765544104/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773910872","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3530160/295921376/04a9056c43dd09fd5dce222be1893074acb42248/1765544104/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773910872","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3530160/295921376/04a9056c43dd09fd5dce222be1893074acb42248/1765544104/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773910872","id":257248528,"name":"Heartreasure Launch trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257248528/0d7b1699c218d3b648066aef5e7aae92dc69fc6e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773910872"}],"name":"Heartreasure: Stellar Journey","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","select